{
  "key": "pattern/uk-garage-2step",
  "kind": "pattern",
  "summary": "UK garage 2-step, 1 bar: skipping kick (1 and the and of 2), snare on 2 and 4, swung hats",
  "tags": [
    "uk garage",
    "2-step",
    "garage",
    "speed garage",
    "burial",
    "shuffle",
    "swung",
    "drums"
  ],
  "devices": [],
  "links": [],
  "checked": {
    "how": "written",
    "by": "claude (genre write-ups)",
    "date": "2026-11-12",
    "opendaw": "652e6ca"
  },
  "body": [
    "Around 130–138 BPM. No kick on 3: the gap is the 'skip'. Hats swung (late off-beats); a rimshot or shaker fills the 16ths. Burial's version: the same skeleton, quieter and dusty, hits slightly off the grid."
  ],
  "pattern": {
    "type": "drums",
    "mini": "[bd:0.95 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ bd:0.75 ~ ~ bd:0.6 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~, ~ [sd:0.9, cp:0.5] ~ [sd:0.9, cp:0.5], [hh:0.5 hh:0.35]*4, [~ oh:0.4 ~ ~]*2, ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ rim:0.4]",
    "swing": 0.58
  },
  "apply": {
    "params": {
      "track": {
        "type": "track",
        "about": "the drum track (a kit)"
      },
      "from_bar": {
        "type": "number",
        "optional": true
      },
      "bars": {
        "type": "number",
        "optional": true
      }
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "op": "pattern",
        "input": {
          "track": "$track",
          "from_bar": "$from_bar",
          "bars": "$bars"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
